Offline identity cache for XUser sign-in

When Microsoft is unreachable, XUserAddAsync(AddDefaultUserSilently) returns
the identity of the last complete network sign-in in this prefix (XUID,
gamertags, age group, endpoint tables; never a token). Token requests then
fail with the WinHTTP connect error and XNetworkingGetConnectivityHint reports
local access. XODUS_FORCE_OFFLINE=1 forces the unreachable path for probes.

